Package: mcp-server-graylog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcp (>= 1:2.0.0),
 python3-mcp-types,
 python3-fastmcp (>= 4.0.10),
Description: stdio MCP server for Graylog
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for Graylog. Bridge mode forwards to
 the experimental /api/mcp endpoint of Graylog 7.1+. API mode calls the
 REST API with a fixed set of read-only tools (system, streams, search,
 fields). Authentication is Basic, built from GRAYLOG_API_TOKEN.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-graylog
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-graylog (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Graylog MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-graylog. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-graylog binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
